    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are stuck in a time loop slap-bang in the golden age of gaming. Step back into the 90s with this thrilling modern-retro 2D platformer, bursting with a vibrant vintage aesthetic. Grab your rad snapback, crack open a Sunny D, and dive headfirst into the world of <i>Fuzz</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting and fast-paced 2D platforming adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 6 vibrant worlds, each with 3 unique acts packed with fun mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 20+ challenges featuring medals and high score rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your nostalgia with CRT TV simulation options for the perfect retro vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack based on the Yamaha YM2612 (Found in Sega Genesis consoles)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
